  "description": "Japanese Font Bundle\nThe Japanese Style Font Bundle is a curated type collection inspired by traditional Japanese aesthetics blended with modern display design. Featuring bold strokes, sharp forms, and expressive character shapes, this bundle brings a strong cultural atmosphere with a contemporary visual edge.\nEach font is designed for impactful display use, making it ideal for projects that require a powerful identity and distinctive style. From traditional-inspired lettering to modern Japanese display forms, these typefaces deliver character, contrast, and visual drama. Whether you’re designing posters, branding, apparel graphics, game visuals, or cultural-themed artwork, this bundle provides a versatile typographic set that captures the spirit of Japanese design in a modern context.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Japanese Font Bundle</p>\n<p>The Japanese Style Font Bundle is a curated type collection inspired by traditional Japanese aesthetics blended with modern display design. Featuring bold strokes, sharp forms, and expressive character shapes, this bundle brings a strong cultural atmosphere with a contemporary visual edge.</p>\n<p>Each font is designed for impactful display use, making it ideal for projects that require a powerful identity and distinctive style. From traditional-inspired lettering to modern Japanese display forms, these typefaces deliver character, contrast, and visual drama. Whether you’re designing posters, branding, apparel graphics, game visuals, or cultural-themed artwork, this bundle provides a versatile typographic set that captures the spirit of Japanese design in a modern context.</p>",
